OL,3,GNEWSABatmobile glimpsed on Glasgow's
OL,4,Astreets as fans prepare for film shoot
OL,5,
OL,6,FOne of pop culture's most famous
OL,7,Fvehicles has been spotted on the
OL,8,Fstreets of Glasgow, as filming is set
OL,9,Fto begin on superhero sequel The
OL,10,FBatman: Part II.
OL,12,FSharp-eyed locals saw the Batmobile on
OL,13,FSt Vincent Street on Monday, as fans of
OL,14,Fthe Dark Knight started visiting
OL,15,Flocations expected to be used in the
OL,16,Fnew film.
OL,18,FOther vehicles seen include police cars
OL,19,Fmarked with Gotham Police signs and
OL,20,FSWAT vehicles, while bus shelters now
OL,21,Fhave timetables displayed for Gotham.
OL,23,APub: 18-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,429,420,260,160,0,100
