OL,3,GNEWSABatmobile glimpsed on Glasgow's
OL,4,Astreets as fans prepare for film shoot
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Kingston Bridge, Newton Street,
OL,7,FBothwell Street and North Street are
OL,8,Fthought to be the main filming areas in
OL,9,Fthe city, with road restrictions
OL,10,Falready in place and, in some cases,
OL,11,Frunning through until September.
